<title>UK: Glenmorangie year profits rise 19 pct.</title>
<headline>Glenmorangie year profits rise 19 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		 41.26		 vs 39.97</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)  13.20		 up 10 pct</p>
<p> Pretax			 7.8		  vs  6.57</p>
<p> Turnover		    46.1		  vs 38.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Earnings per share and total dividend relate to A class shares. A class shares carry limited voting rights.</p>
<p>Company reported a 45 percent increase in cased sales of whisky with Glenmorangie leading.</p>
<p>Full company name - Glenmorangie Plc</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
